    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "London-founded (Daniel Baer, Daniel Pianetti) digital design and development studio, small team (LinkedIn lists 2-10, HQ London plus a San Diego, US office). Builds bespoke, high-craft websites and full ecommerce platforms (mostly custom Shopify) with in-house front and backend development; also does full brand identity work on some projects (e.g. Project Native Informant's ten-year rebrand). Client roster is high-end fashion and art/culture: Fendi, Givenchy, Denim Tears, YMC, LN-CC, Serpentine, Blue Mountain School, Marfa Journal, Fantastic Man. Active and current, work through 2026 on site (QP Magazine, KO Collective). Senior/established boutique studio level, over a decade of ecommerce work per their own site copy; no first-hand engagement yet.",
